<v Ira Glass>[致谢]

00:57:41.550 --> 00:57:50.400
<v Ira Glass>Covers of the song "The Cat Came Back" today were performed for us by Nedelle Torrisi, the band Headache City, and Mike Treese and DJ Rude One.
<v Ira Glass>今天歌曲《猫又回来了》的翻唱版由Nedelle Torrisi、头痛城市乐队以及迈克·特里斯和DJ Rude One为我们表演。

00:57:50.400 --> 00:57:59.300
<v Ira Glass>(SUBJECT) NEDELLE TORRISI [SINGING] So I gave him to a scientist destined for the moon. The cat was used for ballast in an outer space balloon.
<v Ira Glass>（主题）NEDELLE TORRISI [演唱] 所以我把他给了去月球的科学家。那只猫在外太空气球里被当作压舱物。

00:57:59.300 --> 00:58:08.050
<v Ira Glass>You know, you can download today's program at our archives at audible.com/thisamericanlife. This American Life is distributed by Public Radio International.
<v Ira Glass>你知道，你可以从我们的audible.com/thisamericanlife档案中下载今天的节目。《美国生活》由国际公共广播电台发行。

00:58:08.050 --> 00:58:30.830
<v Ira Glass>[FUNDING CREDITS]
<v Ira Glass>[资助鸣谢]

00:58:30.830 --> 00:58:44.750
<v Ira Glass>WBEZ management oversight for our program, Mr. Torey Malatia, who has heard what we say about him at the end of every single show. And he has talked to a special public relations consultant, who helped him put together, finally, after all these years, a response. Here it is.
<v Ira Glass>我们节目的WBEZ管理监督，托里·马拉蒂亚先生，他听过我们每一期节目结尾对他说的评价。他已经和一位特别的公共关系顾问谈过，那位顾问帮助他最终，在这么多年之后，准备了一个回应。在这里。

00:58:44.750 --> 00:58:46.850
<v Michael Baumier>Stop it, you buttheads.
<v Michael Baumier>停下，你们这些混蛋。

00:58:46.850 --> 00:58:59.420
<v Ira Glass>Back next week, with more stories of This American Life.
<v Ira Glass>下周回来，带来更多《美国生活》的故事。

00:58:59.420 --> 00:59:04.420
